  "details": "After trying 20 times in different ways, every time i try to \"New Build\" my world, either as a Test or Publish, the build crashes to desktop half-way thorugh the \"Building scene\" step. \nOn my crash, i have zero errors nor any crash report. I have tried reimporting the SDK, deleting every gameobject minus the Scene itself, floor, and the Main Camera. I have tried this without the Camera as well. It crashes the same.\nOn another separate project, i am able to run a Test Build so it is not my Unity. \n\nThis is the only error i get on re-entering my project. \nAssets/VRCSDK/Dependencies/VRChat/Editor/VRC_SdkControlPanel.cs(11,17): warning CS0414: The private field `VRC_SdkControlPanel.forceNewFileCreation' is assigned but its value is never used",
